ared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"RXY89AX0vz6gchV8T1r1Gg","review_id":"uLpc5dmAI1FtGOq5_JS5IA","date":"2017-09-15T18:02:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9405396580696106,"text_excerpt":"My friends and I went there for their happy hour specials and the backyard like atmosphere. Definitely one of small roof top bars in the city but the ambiance was so relaxing! A great place for a get together after work with some coworkers and enjoy some drinks. Check out the drink of the day too!"},{"business_id":"RXY89AX0vz6gchV8T1r1Gg","review_id":"ch4Phpt_jdchvrsmUYEZFA","date":"2017-05-28T17:44:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9321978092193604,"text_excerpt":"Really good happy hour deals! The staff was friendly and was good at explaining what different drinks would be like. The rooftop bar is small, but it wasn't crowded on a Friday late afternoon. The succulents are pretty to look at as well, so it's pretty nice. The bar downstairs didn't have as great happy hour deals, but they did have a few. We went down because we just needed some air conditioning. Overall, I would recommend this as a chill spot to bring guests. I'll definitely go back, and the food menu looked good so I'll have to try dinner there."},{"business_id":"RXY89AX0vz6gchV8T1r1Gg","review_id":"Qp6cpuonsgF4N6VfJXLilw","date":"2018-12-18T19:24:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9252007007598877,"text_excerpt":"I love the Catahoula! I have been here numerous times. I feel like there's a magnetic force drawing me here each time I come to NoLa as I just always happen to stumble upon it. It is a very fun rooftop atmosphere. They often have a DJ playing. We recently stopped in around 9pm on A Friday night and it wasn't that busy surprisingly. But it was nice to sit outside and enjoy the music. Attentive and friendly service, good drinks, and fair prices. Plus, the view from the beautiful rooftop cant be beat!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"RXY89AX0vz6gchV8T1r1Gg","photo_id":"6ymyHlRIEFfRsHWFvJuSvQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/6ymyHlRIEFfRsHWFvJuSvQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9584159851074219},{"business_id":"RXY89AX0vz6gchV8T1r1Gg","photo_id":"wzVq-UwfwlXSfeaVrNUhCQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/wzVq-UwfwlXSfeaVrNUhCQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8865613341331482},{"business_id":"RXY89AX0vz6gchV8T1r1Gg","photo_id":"LK-Wpn3S9ZINyOMmBa5Mvg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LK-Wpn3S9ZINyOMmBa5Mvg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8536608815193176}]},"notebook_case":null}
